epos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingOfTheMultiverse/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingOfTheMultiverse/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"63abcc00e952c9244be5460d217fe723f55b8a99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KingOfTheMultiverse/fxrp-agent-radar/commits/63abcc00e952c9244be5460d217fe723f55b8a99","html_url":"https://github.com/KingOfTheMultiverse/fxrp-agent-radar/commit/63abcc00e952c9244be5460d217fe723f55b8a99"}]},{"sha":"63abcc00e952c9244be5460d217fe723f55b8a99","node_id":"C_kwDOTmseGdoAKDYzYWJjYzAwZTk1MmM5MjQ0YmU1NDYwZDIxN2ZlNzIzZjU1YjhhOTk","commit":{"author":{"name":"KingOfTheMultiverse","email":"251525216+KingOfTheMultiverse@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-29T03:24:04Z"},"committer":{"name":"KingOfTheMultiverse","email":"251525216+KingOfTheMultiverse@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-29T03:24:04Z"},"message":"feat(web): severity stripes, tabular numerics, and an offline single-file build\n\nThe dashboard fetched data.json, which browsers block under file:// — a reviewer\nopening the file directly got an empty page. build-standalone.mjs inlines the\nsnapshot so the page needs no server and no network.\n\nAlso reworks the visual language for a risk tool rather than a document: a\nseverity stripe encodes row state in form so it survives greyscale and colour\nblindness, numerics move to a tabular mono face, status becomes a labelled pill,\nand the neutrals carry a slight cool bias toward the accent instead of being\nflat grey.","tree":{"sha":"6039599b61276b3fdcd948fea6c9809d76a51a37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KingOfTheMultiverse/fxrp-agent-radar/git/trees/6039599b61276b3fdcd948fea6c9809d76a51a37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KingOfTheMultiverse/fxrp-agent-radar/git/commits/63abcc00e952c9244be5460d217fe723f55b8a99","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload"